  "content": "<lightimg src=\"https://codex-content.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/images/1530512716998-rabbit-2.png\" bg=\"#a65353\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1920\"></lightimg>\n\n<p>Light-ribbon study for <br/><em>A Stanford Bunny Asleep in the Downs</em></p>",
